# Research
tc.research_category.ZENITH=Zenith
kami.research.zenith_base.title=Zenith
kami.research.zenith_base.title.subtitle=The highest point
kami.research.zenith_base.stage.1=This might be my magnum opus. I have the potential to reach beyond anything I could ever imagine, and perhaps... become a god myself.

# -- AWAKENED ICHOR
kami.research.awakened_ichorium.addenda.1=Interestingly, I have discovered that harvesting any block with an awakened ichorium tool will cause any drops to appear at my feet.<BR>While not very useful when harvesting single blocks, this effect will ensure that there is a much smaller chance of harvested materials being destroyed by falling into lava or the void when harvesting large areas.
kami.research.awakened_ichorweave.addenda.1=It appears that awakened ichorweave equipment has a resonance that only occurs when worn by a living creature.<BR>When equipped with a full set of awakened ichorweave armor, all damage taken is reduced by 80%.

# -- AWAKENED ICHORIUM AXE
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_axe.title=Ichorium Axe of the Stormbreaker
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_axe.title.subtitle=Rainbow bridge not yet implemented
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_axe.stage.1=With how readily Ichorium seems to accept aspects, I figure there must be a way to further empower the axe.<BR>Perhaps a heavy infusion of natural aspects will yield some result?
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_axe.stage.2=This new axe, which I have named the Stormbreaker, is a truly fascinating tool.<BR>The amount of Herba essentia infused into the axe when it was created indicated some affiliation with plants, and that proved to be true.<BR>The axe is capable of chopping down entire trees with a single swing, even harvesting entire greatwood trees in seconds. Sneaking disables this power, allowing me to harvest single blocks at a time.<BR>Additionally, the axe shows a strange connection to the user. I once slipped and dropped the axe, yet no sooner had it impacted the ground than it bounced back into my hand.<BR>Upon testing, I found that throwing the axe appears to imbue it with power, traveling a short distance returning to my hand.<BR>I can cycle through the different impact effects by sneaking and interacting with the axe. The powers I have found are catalogued on the following pages.<PAGE>Impact: Damaging<DIV>Deals weapon damage when striking an enemy.<PAGE>Impact: Thundering<DIV>Summons a bolt of lighting when striking an enemy or the ground.<PAGE>Impact: Detonation<DIV>Spawns a small explosion that does not damage terrain when striking an enemy or the ground.<BR>Explosion strength increases with higher throw velocity.<PAGE>Impact: Explosion<DIV>Spawns a large explosion that damages terrain when colliding with an enemy or the ground.<BR>Explosion strength increases with higher throw velocity.

# -- AWAKENED ICHORIUM PICKAXE
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_pickaxe.title=Ichorium Pickaxe of the Tunneler
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_pickaxe.title.subtitle=Who needs a quarry?
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_pickaxe.stage.1=After journeying so far into the depths of the arcane, surely the answer isn't as simple as it seems?<BR>If ichorium tools are capable of achieving an "awakening" under the right circumstances, perhaps the best choice is to infuse the tool with the aspect it is normally associated with.
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_pickaxe.stage.2=The awakened ichorium pickaxe can only be described as the tunneler's dream.<BR>Capable of harvesting massive areas of stone simultaneously, it is truly a marvel.<BR>Sneaking and right-clicking while holding the tool allows me to cycle through the harvest area levels.<BR>Holding right-click empowers the pickaxe, which, upon release, will dig a tunnel in the direction I am facing.

# -- AWAKENED ICHORIUM SHOVEL
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_shovel.title=Ichorium Shovel of the Gravedigger
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_shovel.title.subtitle=I cast mold earth!
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_shovel.stage.1=I have tried to infuse the ichorium shovel in so many ways, but none of the aspects I have found manage to bind to the tool.<BR>It is almost as if it has a purpose unknown to me... Maybe something more morbid is the answer.
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_shovel.stage.2=I'm not sure if I can categorize this as a success...<BR>Empowering the shovel has allowed it to dig a larger area, but it also seems to have an unsettling affinity for burying creatures alive.<BR>Holding right click causes the shovel to build up charge. Upon release, all entities surrounding me are instantly buried underground, where they slowly suffocate to death.<BR>While effective, it is certainly unsettling to hear animal suffocate just below the surface. Luckily, the shovel can be attuned to only inter specific entities. The specific attunement can be cycled by sneak right clicking while holding the tool.<PAGE>Inter Undead<DIV>Buries all undead entities surrounding the player.<BR>Charge duration increases the interment area.<PAGE>Inter Animals<DIV>Buries all animals surrounding the player.<BR>Charge duration increases the interment area.<PAGE>Inter Hostiles<DIV>Buries all hostile entities surrounding the player.<BR>Charge duration increases the interment area.<PAGE>Inter All<DIV>Buries all creatures surrounding the player.<BR>Charge duration increases the interment area.

# -- AWAKENED ICHORIUM SWORD
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_sword.title=Ichorium Sword of the Titanslayer
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_sword.title.subtitle=Situationally effective
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_sword.stage.1=The ichorium sword is almost too mundane considering its cost. I would have expected such a legendary weapon to be sharper at the very least.<BR>Perhaps it's not the weapon I should focus on, but rather the entity being struck...
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_sword.stage.2=The awakened ichorium sword, which I have named the titanslayer, has the unique ability to attune itself to specific enemy types, granting bonuses when striking attuned enemies.<PAGE>Unattuned<DIV>When not attuned, the awakened sword foregoes any entity attunement bonus.<BR>Instead all energy within the sword is channeled into the blade, doubling the base damage of the weapon.<PAGE>Mortal's Bane<DIV>A bane to all living creatures, when attuned to mortals, the awakened sword bypasses all armor and deals up to 20% of a living entity's maximum hp on every hit.<PAGE>Undead Slayer<DIV>Some might call it a holy sword, but I know better.<BR>When attuned to undeath, the awakened sword bypasses all armor and deals up to 20% of an undead target's maximum health.<PAGE>Dragonslayer<DIV>Legends speak of the greatest warriors who ever lived slaying mighty dragons. While I may not be able to achieve their level of notoriety, the awakened sword can get me close to achieving their feats.<BR>When attuned to dragons, the awakened sword bypasses all armor and deals up to 20% of a dragon's maximum health.<BR>Interestingly, this effect also appears to extend to entities wearing dragon-based armor.<PAGE>Abomination Slayer<DIV>During my studies I have encountered entities that do not fit into any standard categories.<BR>These creatures seem to either be otherworldly Eldritch beings, or Tainted abominations that revel in high-flux environments.<BR>When attuned to abominations, the awakened sword bypasses the armor of tainted or eldritch creatures and deals up to 20% of the target's maximum health.

# -- AWAKENED ICHORWEAVE BOOTS
kami.research.awakened_ichorweave_boots.title=Ichorweave Boots of the Biosphere
kami.research.awakened_ichorweave_boots.title.subtitle="Nature’s guardians" my foot!
kami.research.awakened_ichorweave_boots.stage.1=Closer examination reveals that Ichor is unlike any material I have encountered, almost as though it is asleep...<BR>I wonder what would occur if I managed to awaken or empower ichorweave armor?
kami.research.awakened_ichorweave_boots.stage.2=While I admit I was expecting more, I certainly cannot complain with the results.<BR>When awakened, the ichorweave boots grant the wearer increased movement speed and jump height, similar to the effects granted by the boots of the traveler.<BR>Additionally, the boots grant immunity to slowness effects.<BR>While the effects are relatively mundane, it certainly is nice to no longer have to worry about constantly recharging my boots.

# -- AWAKENED ICHORWEAVE HOOD
kami.research.awakened_ichorweave_hood.title=Ichorweave Hood of the Abyssal Depths
kami.research.awakened_ichorweave_hood.title.subtitle=Peer into the darkness
kami.research.awakened_ichorweave_hood.stage.1=Closer examination reveals that Ichor is unlike any material I have encountered, almost as though it is asleep...<BR>I wonder what would occur if I managed to awaken or empower ichorweave armor?
kami.research.awakened_ichorweave_hood.stage.2=Awakened with tenebrae, it's no suprise the awakened ichorweave hood has an affinity for the depths of the world.<BR>When equipped, the awakened ichorweave hood grants the wearer infinite underwater breathing

# -- AWAKENED ICHORWEAVE LEGGINGS
kami.research.awakened_ichorweave_leggings.title=Ichorweave Leggings of the Burning Mantle
kami.research.awakened_ichorweave_leggings.title.subtitle=Liar liar pants on fire
kami.research.awakened_ichorweave_leggings.stage.1=Closer examination reveals that Ichor is unlike any material I have encountered, almost as though it is asleep...<BR>I wonder what would occur if I managed to awaken or empower ichorweave armor?
kami.research.awakened_ichorweave_leggings.stage.2=Though the amount of ignis involved in the process of awakening the ichorweave leggings was a bit concerning, I cannot argue with the results.<BR>When equipped, The awakened ichorweave leggings grants the wearer immunity to environmental hazards such as fire, lava, poison and wither.<BR>They also grant the ability to double jump. However, the double jumping ability interferes with the same effect from the Cloudstepper Ring.

# -- AWAKENED ICHORWEAVE ROBE
kami.research.awakened_ichorweave_robe.title=Ichorweave Robe of the Stratosphere
kami.research.awakened_ichorweave_robe.title.subtitle=Oxygen not included
kami.research.awakened_ichorweave_robe.stage.1=Closer examination reveals that Ichor is unlike any material I have encountered, almost as though it is asleep...<BR>I wonder what would occur if I managed to awaken or empower ichorweave armor?
kami.research.awakened_ichorweave_robe.stage.2=The Ichorweave Robes have a a strong affinity for the air, similar to what I have experienced with an elytra.<BR>Unlike an elytra, these robes grant unrestricted flight as well as totally negating fall damage.

# -- BOTTOMLESS POUCH
kami.research.bottomless_pouch.title=Bottomless Pouch
kami.research.bottomless_pouch.title.subtitle=Try not to tear it
kami.research.bottomless_pouch.stage.1=I have noticed a very strange phenomenon that occurs when two pieces of ichorcloth are stacked on top of one another.<BR>Upon lifing the edge of the top cloth, I discovered an empty pocket of air between the two pieces of fabric.<BR>While that might not sound impressive, it wasn't until I was able to insert my entire arm into the space that I truly discovered how large it was.<BR>
kami.research.bottomless_pouch.stage.2=The success of my experiment is slightly concerning. While I had originally thought that there might be a way to create something resembling a bag of holding, I did not consider just how much space would be created.<BR>The Bottomless Pouch is a 117 slot bag that can function as a focus pouch.

# -- ICHOR
kami.research.ichor.title=Ichor
kami.research.ichor.title.subtitle=Blood of the Gods
kami.research.ichor.stage.1=All of my experiments into have, up to this point, resulted in relatively mundane materials.<BR>I feel as though there must be a way to go a step further, making a material that transcends physical limitations.
kami.research.ichor.stage.2=Through extensive study in all subjects of thaumaturgy I have discovered a substance that can be considered to be the next step in my endeavours. I have melded some of the most powerful materials together with primordial energy to create this substance.<BR>This extremely powerful substance, which I am calling "Ichor" contains an unimaginable amount of raw awakened power.<BR>I am sure I will be able to put it to use for countless devices in the future.

# -- ICHORIUM
kami.research.ichorium.title=Ichorium
kami.research.ichorium.title.subtitle=A metal harder than diamond
kami.research.ichorium.stage.1=Experimentation has shown that Ichor is capable of bonding to most metals, but the results are useless to a degree that surprised even me.<BR>However, materials that are otherworldy, for lack of a better term, are almost drawn to one another.<BR>While they mix about as well as water and oil, infusion may provide the key to transforming them into a homogeneous material.
kami.research.ichorium.stage.2=I have managed to blend Ichor with void metal to create an entirely new material with completely unique properties.<BR>It is completely impervious to corrosion or damage, yet it is almost as malleable as clay.<BR>I haven't found any uses for it yet, but I know it shouldn't take me too long.

# -- ICHORIUM CASTER
kami.research.ichorium_caster.title=Ichorium Caster's Gauntlet of the Ascended
kami.research.ichorium_caster.title.subtitle="I could simply snap my fingers and they would all cease to exist."
kami.research.ichorium_caster.stage.1=With how successful my other experiments with ichor have been, I cannot help but wonder what would happen if I applied the material to a caster's gauntlet.
kami.research.ichorium_caster.stage.2=Yet again my expectations have been shattered.<BR>Ichor has proven to be an incredible focus material. Spells channeled through the gauntlet have their vis costs reduced by 40%, not including any bonuses from equipment, and any remaining vis drain is distributed in a 5x5 chunk area centered on me.
kami.research.ichorium_caster.addenda.1=Not only does the ichorium gauntlet have better resonance with the local aura, it also appears to be much more malleable than other materials, accepting up to five augments compared to the three of its thaumium or void counterparts.

# -- ICHORIUM TOOLS
kami.research.ichorium_tools.title=Ichorium Tools
kami.research.ichorium_tools.title.subtitle=Pinnacle of design
kami.research.ichorium_tools.stage.1=Normally I would be able to create equipment right away with most other materials, Ichor-based materials however, will require some additional trial and error in order to successfully achieve this.
kami.research.ichorium_tools.stage.2=I now have the ability to construct Ichorium tools. These tools are so powerful that it is impossible for them to break.

# -- ICHORWEAVE ARMOR
kami.research.ichorweave_armor.title=Ichorweave Armor
kami.research.ichorweave_armor.title.subtitle=Unbeatable, Unbreakable, Unpossible
kami.research.ichorweave_armor.stage.1=Normally I would be able to create equipment right away with most other materials, Ichor-based materials however, will require some additional trial and error in order to successfully achieve this.
kami.research.ichorweave_armor.stage.2=I now have the ability to construct the Ichorweave set. The armor set is so powerful that it is impossible for any of the pieces to break, I can also get a decent amount of vis discount out of them.

# -- ICHORWEAVE FABRIC
kami.research.ichorweave_fabric.title=Ichorweave Fabric
kami.research.ichorweave_fabric.title.subtitle=Hope you brought a strong needle
kami.research.ichorweave_fabric.stage.1=Ichor shows a strong reaction towards cloth. If done correctly, I should be able to create the perfect fabric.
kami.research.ichorweave_fabric.stage.2=I now am able to upgrade basic magical fabric into a special ichorweave fabric. It is immune to tearing and it is oddly flexible, imagine the possibilities!

# -- INFUSION ENCHANTMENT: ETERNAL
kami.research.eternal_infusion.title=Infusion Enchantment: Eternal
kami.research.eternal_infusion.title.subtitle=Tools of divinity
kami.research.eternal_infusion.stage.1=Ichor is such a strange substance. It is malleable enough to be worked into tools and armor relatively easily, yet the moment it takes its final shape it is nearly impossible to alter.<BR>Perhaps there is a way to imbue its properties into other tools. Even a thin coating would significantly improve a tool's durability.
kami.research.eternal_infusion.stage.2=I can only describe what I have achieved as incredible.<BR>I set out to increase the durability of my tools, but instead I have found a way to make them completely invulnerable to damage.<BR>Taking what I know from infusion enchantments, I have managed to bind ichor to damagable items almost perfectly. Not only do the infused items retain their original properties, they also become completely unbreakable.

